			<item>
				<title>Rules Dnscontrol</title>
				<link>https://alwaldend.com/docs/projects/rules_dnscontrol/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://alwaldend.com/docs/projects/rules_dnscontrol/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;rules_dnscontrol&lt;/code&gt; packages a DNSControl JavaScript entrypoint together with&#xA;its record configuration files and emits a generated &lt;code&gt;requires.js&lt;/code&gt; manifest&#xA;whose paths match the Bazel runfiles tree.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
